      "description": "The meaning of the operation moves to the activity type https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/activity-type/point-cloud-to-grid, linked by activityType (gp:activityType). The definition no longer defines the operation; it was: \"Writes one value per grid cell from the points falling in it -- by default the z value of the first point -- as a single-band raster.\"",
