      "changeClassification": "substantive",
      "description": "The schema copied on each input and output that had one is replaced by the representation that realizes its data type in the data-formats register (decision D6): inputs/points -> point-cloud-las (schema was {\"type\": \"string\", \"contentEncoding\": \"base64\", \"contentMediaType\": \"application/vnd.las\", \"description\": \"LAS (OGC 17-030r1); application/vnd.las is the IANA-registered media type\"}); outputs/result -> raster-single-band-geotiff (schema was {\"type\": \"string\", \"contentEncoding\": \"base64\", \"contentMediaType\": \"image/tiff\", \"description\": \"GeoTIFF\"}).",
